    "chunk_text": "5. What revised Quality of Service - QoS - Standards and Key Performance Indicators - KPIs - will the TRCSL enforce on all operators regarding coverage, call quality, data speed, latency, network availability, complaint resolution customer satisfaction and compensation for service failures, and how will compliance be independently monitored and publicly reported?\n\nA law had been brought in to write it off; if no payment had been made to Starlink or any foreign operator, that would be taken off from the Inland Revenue debt requirement.\n\n7. Will all operators be subjected to identical licence fees, regulatory charges, taxes and statutory levies, thereby ensuring a competitive level playing field without conferring unfair commercial advantages on any provider?\n\nHon. Speaker, I am informed that for telephone tapping and things like that, access is being given without any court order et cetera. So, just have a look into that.\n\n8. Will the Minister table before Parliament the Mobile Number Portability implementation roadmap, operator readiness reports, the regulatory framework applicable to satellite operators, the licence conditions applicable to Starlink and the Government\u2019s long-term National Telecommunications Competition and Consumer Protection Strategy?\n\nThank you, Sir.\n\n\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d91\u0dbb\u0d82 \u0dc0\u0dd3\u0dbb\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0db1 \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0da9\u0dd2\u0da2\u0dd2 \u0dbd\u0dca \u0d86\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dd9\u0dcf) (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8e\u0bb0\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95 \u0bb5\u0bc0\u0bb0\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba9 - \u0b9f\u0bbf\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd) (The Hon. Eranga Weeraratne - Deputy Minister of Digital Economy) Hon. Speaker, I answer the Question on behalf of the Minister of Digital Economy."
