    "chunk_text": "\u0dd4\u0dab \u0d91\u0dbb\u0d82 \u0dc0\u0dd3\u0dbb\u0dbb\u0dad\u0dca\u0db1 \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0da9\u0dd2\u0da2\u0dd2 \u0dbd\u0dca \u0d86\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0db1\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0dba\u0ddd\u0da2\u0dba \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dd9\u0dcf) (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b8e\u0bb0\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95 \u0bb5\u0bc0\u0bb0\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba9 - \u0b9f\u0bbf\u0b9c\u0bbf\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0 \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd) (The Hon. Eranga Weeraratne - Deputy Minister of Digital Economy) Hon. Speaker, I answer the Question on behalf of the Minister of Digital Economy.\n\ncarry out operational activities and a licence was issued in September, 2024. All technical standards and operational guidelines in line with international standards and best practices were finalized in coordination with all these operators. The total cost of this project is borne both by fixed and mobile operators. However, one fixed operator has subsequently requested that this approach be reconsidered, stating that the implementation of Fixed Number Portability across their fixed network together with newer IP and fibre platforms would require substantial modifications to routing, signalling, subscriber-management, billing and operational-support systems as well as extensive testing. That operator has, therefore, expressed concerns regarding the additional time, effort and cost involved and the absence of a clear commercial return on such investment. The operator has further stated that the current public demand is predominantly for Mobile Number Portability.\n\nThat maybe why the Hon. Member also specifically requested for information about Mobile Number Portability.\n\nThe operator has further said that fixed connections are increasingly used for fibre-based Internet access, where changing broadband providers is generally not dependent on retaining the associated telephone number in the same manner as in mobile services."
