    "chunk_size_bytes": 379,
    "chunk_text": "Also, Hon. Deputy Minister, is there telephone tapping on WhatsApp or on normal telephones because that is a general issue which many people speak of? When certain things are spoken of, that information gets passed on prior to taking that action, which is a very alarming state. So, I would appreciate it if an honest answer comes from you, taking that matter into consideration."
