    "chunk_text": "Effect of Cost of Living and Inflation on the People [Col. 2121] Progress of Investigations into Disappearances and Killings in North and East during War [Col. 2133] INVESTMENT RECEIVED AND EMPLOYMENT GENERATED AT COLOMBO PORT CITY:\n\nStatement by Deputy Minister of Finance and Planning [Col. 2140]\n\nFRAUDS INVOLVING ISSUANCE OF JOB VISA AND FOREIGN EMPLOYMENT OPPORTUNITIES:\n\nNon-Facilitation of Hon. Chaminda Wijesiri\u2019s Request to Attend Parliament [Col. 2151]\n\nPROMOTION OF EXPORT AGRICULTURE (AMENDMENT) BILL:\n\nRead the First time [Col. 2154]\n\nPRIVATE MEMBERS' MOTIONS:\n\nPromoting Self-Sufficiency in Milk Production [Cols. 2155-2166] Developing a Programme to Protect the Mangrove Ecosystem [Cols. 2167-2179] Formulation of a System to Stop the Ripening of Fruits Using Chemicals [Cols. 2179-2194] Formulation of a National Policy and Methodology for the Wildlife Management in Sri Lanka [Cols. 2194-2206]Expanding the Railway Line from Batticaloa to Pottuvil or the Railway Line from Matara to Kalmunai [Cols. 2206-2220] Establishment of a Commission to Investigate the Unilateral and Forced Cremation of the Remains of Deceased Muslims during the Covid-19 Pandemic [Cols. 2221-2235] Establishment of a Special Development Fund Dedicated to Reduce Regional Disparities in Development [Cols. 2236-2249] ADJOURNMENT QUESTIONS [Cols. 2250-2258]\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0d9c\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\n\u0baa\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0bb3\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bae\u0bcd\n\nPARLIAMENT \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2013\u2014-\n\n2026 \u0d85\u0d9c \u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 07\u0dc0\u0db1 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf 2026 \u0b93\u0b95\u0bb8\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bcd 07, \u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bae\u0bc8\n\nFriday, 07th August, 2026 \u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2013\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2013\u2014\u2014\n\n\u0db4\u0d